# Pairs with NonEnrolledDropped. A run for a tree not enrolled here is parked
# instead of dropped, so a peer spawns a dead-letter activation per tree id it
# names.
MODULE: ReceiverDeadLettersNonEnrolled
TARGET: NonEnrolledDropped
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a non-enrolled tree's run is dead-lettered
PERTURBS: ApplyRun

--- FIND
        result == IF mode = NotEnrolled THEN "dropped"
--- REPLACE
        result == IF mode = NotEnrolled THEN "deadLettered"
--- END